ASP.NET Core 的中间件管道是处理 HTTP 请求的核心机制，每个请求都会经过一系列中间件的处理。

## RequestDelegate

RequestDelegate 是中间件的核心委托类型：
```csharp
public delegate Task RequestDelegate(HttpContext context);
```

每个中间件本质上就是一个处理 HttpContext 并返回 Task 的函数。

## 中间件的执行流程

中间件按照注册顺序形成管道，请求从前往后经过每个中间件，响应从后往前经过：
```
请求 → 中间件1 → 中间件2 → 中间件3 → 终端
响应 ← 中间件1 ← 中间件2 ← 中间件3 ← 终端
```

每个中间件可以选择：
1. 调用 `next()` 将请求传递给下一个中间件
2. 短路管道，直接返回响应

## Use/Map/Run 扩展方法

**Use**：注册中间件，可以调用 next()
```csharp
app.Use(async (context, next) =>
{
    // 请求处理前
    Console.WriteLine("Before");

    await next(); // 调用下一个中间件

    // 响应处理后
    Console.WriteLine("After");
});
```

**Map**：根据路径分支管道
```csharp
app.Map("/api", apiApp =>
{
    apiApp.Use(async (context, next) =>
    {
        // 处理 /api 路径的请求
        await next();
    });
});
```

**MapWhen**：根据条件分支管道
```csharp
app.MapWhen(context => context.Request.Path.StartsWithSegments("/admin"), adminApp =>
{
    // 处理管理员路径
});
```

**Run**：注册终端中间件，不调用 next()
```csharp
app.Run(async context =>
{
    // 终端中间件，不调用 next()
    await context.Response.WriteAsync("Hello World!");
});
```

## 内置中间件

ASP.NET Core 提供了丰富的内置中间件：

```csharp
app.UseRouting();          // 路由
app.UseAuthentication();   // 认证
app.UseAuthorization();    // 授权
app.UseCors();             // 跨域
app.UseResponseCompression(); // 响应压缩
app.UseStaticFiles();      // 静态文件
app.UseEndpoints(endpoints =>
{
    endpoints.MapControllers();
});
```

## 自定义中间件

**内联中间件**：
```csharp
app.Use(async (context, next) =>
{
    var stopwatch = Stopwatch.StartNew();

    await next();

    stopwatch.Stop();
    Console.WriteLine($"请求耗时: {stopwatch.ElapsedMilliseconds}ms");
});
```

**基于类的中间件**：
```csharp
public class RequestTimingMiddleware
{
    private readonly RequestDelegate _next;

    public RequestTimingMiddleware(RequestDelegate next)
    {
        _next = next;
    }

    public async Task InvokeAsync(HttpContext context)
    {
        var stopwatch = Stopwatch.StartNew();

        await _next(context);

        stopwatch.Stop();
        context.Response.Headers.Add("X-Request-Duration", 
            $"{stopwatch.ElapsedMilliseconds}ms");
    }
}

// 注册
app.UseMiddleware<RequestTimingMiddleware>();
```

**扩展方法注册**：
```csharp
public static class RequestTimingMiddlewareExtensions
{
    public static IApplicationBuilder UseRequestTiming(this IApplicationBuilder app)
    {
        return app.UseMiddleware<RequestTimingMiddleware>();
    }
}

// 使用
app.UseRequestTiming();
```

## 中间件的执行顺序

中间件的注册顺序非常重要：
```csharp
// 正确顺序
app.UseExceptionHandler("/Error");
app.UseHsts();
app.UseHttpsRedirection();
app.UseStaticFiles();
app.UseRouting();
app.UseCors();
app.UseAuthentication();
app.UseAuthorization();
app.UseEndpoints(endpoints => endpoints.MapControllers());
```

## 短路与分支

**短路**：中间件不调用 next()，直接返回响应
```csharp
app.Use(async (context, next) =>
{
    if (context.Request.Path == "/health")
    {
        await context.Response.WriteAsync("OK");
        return; // 短路
    }

    await next();
});
```

**分支**：根据条件执行不同的中间件管道
```csharp
app.MapWhen(context => context.Request.Method == "GET", getApp =>
{
    getApp.Run(async context => await context.Response.WriteAsync("GET Request"));
});
```

using System;
using System.Diagnostics;
using System.Threading.Tasks;
using Microsoft.AspNetCore.Builder;
using Microsoft.AspNetCore.Http;
using Microsoft.Extensions.DependencyInjection;

namespace MiddlewarePipelineDemo
{
    // 基于类的中间件
    public class RequestLoggingMiddleware
    {
        private readonly RequestDelegate _next;
        private readonly ILogger<RequestLoggingMiddleware> _logger;

        public RequestLoggingMiddleware(RequestDelegate next, ILogger<RequestLoggingMiddleware> logger)
        {
            _next = next;
            _logger = logger;
        }

        public async Task InvokeAsync(HttpContext context)
        {
            var requestId = Guid.NewGuid().ToString();
            context.Items["RequestId"] = requestId;

            _logger.LogInformation($"[{requestId}] 开始处理 {context.Request.Method} {context.Request.Path}");

            try
            {
                await _next(context);
                _logger.LogInformation($"[{requestId}] 请求完成，状态码: {context.Response.StatusCode}");
            }
            catch (Exception ex)
            {
                _logger.LogError(ex, $"[{requestId}] 请求处理失败");
                throw;
            }
        }
    }

    public class RequestTimingMiddleware
    {
        private readonly RequestDelegate _next;

        public RequestTimingMiddleware(RequestDelegate next)
        {
            _next = next;
        }

        public async Task InvokeAsync(HttpContext context)
        {
            var stopwatch = Stopwatch.StartNew();

            await _next(context);

            stopwatch.Stop();
            var duration = stopwatch.ElapsedMilliseconds;

            context.Response.Headers.Add("X-Request-Duration", $"{duration}ms");

            if (duration > 1000)
            {
                Console.WriteLine($"警告: 请求 {context.Request.Path} 耗时 {duration}ms");
            }
        }
    }

    // 中间件扩展方法
    public static class MiddlewareExtensions
    {
        public static IApplicationBuilder UseRequestLogging(this IApplicationBuilder app)
        {
            return app.UseMiddleware<RequestLoggingMiddleware>();
        }

        public static IApplicationBuilder UseRequestTiming(this IApplicationBuilder app)
        {
            return app.UseMiddleware<RequestTimingMiddleware>();
        }
    }

    class Program
    {
        static void Main(string[] args)
        {
            var builder = WebApplication.CreateBuilder(args);
            var app = builder.Build();

            // 注册中间件
            app.UseRequestLogging();
            app.UseRequestTiming();

            // 内联中间件示例
            app.Use(async (context, next) =>
            {
                // 添加自定义头
                context.Response.Headers.Add("X-Custom-Header", "MiddlewareDemo");

                await next();
            });

            // 路径分支
            app.Map("/api", apiApp =>
            {
                apiApp.Use(async (context, next) =>
                {
                    Console.WriteLine("API 中间件");
                    await next();
                });

                apiApp.Run(async context =>
                {
                    await context.Response.WriteAsync("API Response");
                });
            });

            // 条件分支
            app.MapWhen(
                context => context.Request.Path.StartsWithSegments("/admin"),
                adminApp =>
                {
                    adminApp.Use(async (context, next) =>
                    {
                        // 管理员认证检查
                        if (!context.User.Identity.IsAuthenticated)
                        {
                            context.Response.StatusCode = 401;
                            return;
                        }
                        await next();
                    });

                    adminApp.Run(async context =>
                    {
                        await context.Response.WriteAsync("Admin Area");
                    });
                });

            // 终端中间件
            app.Run(async context =>
            {
                await context.Response.WriteAsync("Hello World!");
            });

            app.Run();
        }
    }
}
